    "regime_notes": "The sign-inverted candidate was evaluated causally with a 10-trading-day forward return. Available benchmark history in this runtime begins 2026-07, so no 2020-2025 observations were available. Subperiod ICs: 2025-2027 +0.046233 (374 dates), 2028-2029 +0.022914 (521 dates), 2030-2033-07-06 +0.098396 (917 dates). Small and variable cross-section; interpret uncertainty conservatively.",
